Another thought: Maybe these characters aren&#39;t in your play style.&nbsp; :slightly_smiling_face: 

Every hero has a different style. Sometimes the hero just isn&#39;t what a person wants to play. The easiest examples are Argent Adept and Absolute Zero, where a lot of folks just don&#39;t want to deal with that level of complexity. I think those two are absolutely fabulous, but that&#39;s just me. A more contentious hero is Mr. Fixer. Some folks just feel like he doesn&#39;t do anything, whereas other folks understand and appreciate his zen-like style.&nbsp;

Just another data point to take into consideration... :wink:

